# Please do not use this file to train or fine-tune AI models.
# _x7_heathaze: d3xpdm1, whose pack lacks the heatHaze stages. The removed OpenGL backend failed to link heatHaze on the first load
# and loaded on the retry (loadAttempts 2); Direct3D 12 links it at once. Its GL reference ran alone, so it still runs alone.
map game/mp/d3xpdm1
at 0 god
at 0 notarget
impulse 40 16
move 10 250 yaw=90
move 260 300 pitch=30
move 300 340 pitch=-30
end 340
capture 0 340 every=10 fps=60
capture 120 125
